2373	 *
2374	 * This is the whole format question in fifteen lines. A DMA REF tag's payload
2375	 * is NOT interpreted by the DMAC - every word of it reaches VIF1 as a VIFcode -
2376	 * so a block that a single REF replays may contain no tags. Each tag in the
